&lt;ul data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;2264&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xg4f71&quot; data-start=&quot;975&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;977&quot; data-end=&quot;1075&quot;&gt;Recruit, develop, and retain a world-class team of enterprise sellers&amp;nbsp;on time and on budget.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gotd7j&quot; data-start=&quot;1076&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1078&quot; data-end=&quot;1214&quot;&gt;Enable Regional Directors and Enterprise Account Executives to achieve&amp;nbsp;key productivity metrics and growth milestones consistently&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18be2mk&quot; data-start=&quot;1215&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1217&quot; data-end=&quot;1350&quot;&gt;Drive a disciplined approach to pipeline generation, leveraging field sales, marketing, channel partners, and sales development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
