&lt;p data-start=&quot;1596&quot; data-end=&quot;1715&quot;&gt;Deliver accurate monthly and quarterly forecasting through disciplined deal inspection and forecast methodologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d6ia0j&quot; data-start=&quot;1716&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1718&quot; data-end=&quot;1808&quot;&gt;Develop and expand strategic channel partnerships across Central and Southern Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
